id: QUAL-057
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Throwing string literal instead of Error object
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: throw\s+['"`]
    message: "Throwing a string literal — loses stack trace. Throw new Error('message') instead."
fix: Always throw Error objects. throw new Error('message') preserves the stack trace for debugging.
